@startuml
title CAN non-destructive arbitration

start
:Bus idle;
:Node A starts sending ID 0x100;
:Node B starts sending ID 0x200;
:Both nodes transmit and monitor the bus;

if (A sends dominant 0\nB sends recessive 1) then (dominant wins)
  :Node B reads dominant\nwhile sending recessive;
  :Node B loses arbitration;
  :Node B stops transmitting\nand retries later;
else (same bus level)
  :Both nodes continue arbitration;
endif

:Node A keeps transmitting;
:Winning frame is not corrupted;
stop
@enduml
